## 1. 为什么研究关联 GGM 树？

MPC-in-the-Head（MPCitH，脑内多方计算）允许证明者在本地模拟多方计算，再通过承诺（commitment）与选择性开放（selective opening）证明自己知道满足公开约束的秘密见证，而不直接公开见证。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://starry-juniper.github.io/post/%E3%80%8AOn%20the%20Security%20of%20MPC-in-the-Head%20Signatures%20with%20Correlated%20GGM%20Trees%E3%80%8B-jing-du-%EF%BC%88-yi-%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A-cong-%20MPC-in-the-Head%20-dao-guan-lian-%20GGM%20-shu-de-he-xin-gai-nian-yu-mi-ma-xue-ji-chu.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:05:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>测试博客</title><link>https://starry-juniper.github.io/post/ce-shi-bo-ke.html</link><description>**这里是正文**。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://starry-juniper.github.io/post/ce-shi-bo-ke.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 10:24:46 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>